  "scope": "Logical literal using contexts retain checked proposition kinds. A nullary value discharges its instantiated obligations from actual scoped evidence or checked static truth at its reference; False and unresolved predicates cannot be guessed. The added unresolved control is strengthened with a checked quantified declaration and refusal of its actual unsolved-index reference; its entire refinement group reruns against the identical Native production library. The earlier declaration-stage-only control remains in the earlier frozen evidence. Functions retain the existing direct-application rule, and runtime Booleans and anonymous refinement-former grammar remain distinct. All15 original complete groups pass without skips/filters, including all13 machine-consumer cases at256M normal and smaller32M poisoned clients. Added real provider/facade runtime and metadata round trip retains contract identity and refusal of False. All original tests/assertions, immutable Native22 seed/library roles and actual task-capture counterexamples stay intact. Both current1c76 and private3268 exact44-module input projects pass. Current Cinch components/full compiler/API, final matching full bootstrap and all original Acceptance1-5 requirements remain required.",
